@startuml
' Palette: class; based on the Visual Paradigm guide samples (see README).
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #000000
hide circle
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ClassBorderColor #000000
skinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 40
top to bottom direction

class PersonalAssistantController <<Java boundary>> {
  +postMessage(id: UUID, body: MessageRequest): AssistantResponse
}
class MessageRequest <<DTO>> {
  +message: String
  +selectedDocumentIds: UUID[]
}
class PersonalAssistantService <<Java control>> {
  +run(userId: UUID, id: UUID, request: MessageRequest): AssistantResponse
}
class ConversationRepository <<Java repository>> {
  +loadOwnedSnapshot(userId: UUID, id: UUID): ConversationSnapshot
}
class AiClient <<HTTP adapter>> {
  +runAssistant(request: InternalAssistantRequest): AssistantResponse
}
class SingleOrchestratorAgent <<Python agent>> {
  +run(request: InternalAssistantRequest): AssistantResponse
  -selectTool(message: String): ToolName
}
class AskDocumentTool <<Python tool>> {
  +execute(args: AskArgs, scope: AuthorizedScope): AnswerResult
}
class SummarizeDocumentTool <<Python tool>> {
  +execute(args: SummaryArgs, scope: AuthorizedScope): SummaryResult
}
class GenerateQuizTool <<Python tool>> {
  +execute(args: QuizArgs, scope: AuthorizedScope): QuizDraftResult
}
class ScopedRetriever <<Python service>> {
  +search(scope: AuthorizedScope, query: String): EvidenceSet
}
class AssistantResponse <<DTO>> {
  +status: AssistantStatus
  +capability: Capability
  +answer: String?
  +quizDraft: QuizDraft?
  +citations: PageCitation[]
}

PersonalAssistantController ..> MessageRequest
PersonalAssistantController --> PersonalAssistantService
PersonalAssistantService --> ConversationRepository
PersonalAssistantService --> AiClient
AiClient ..> SingleOrchestratorAgent : internal HTTP
SingleOrchestratorAgent --> AskDocumentTool
SingleOrchestratorAgent --> SummarizeDocumentTool
SingleOrchestratorAgent --> GenerateQuizTool
AskDocumentTool --> ScopedRetriever
SummarizeDocumentTool --> ScopedRetriever
GenerateQuizTool --> ScopedRetriever
PersonalAssistantService ..> AssistantResponse

note bottom of SingleOrchestratorAgent
Agent chỉ chọn một tool trong allowlist.
Thiếu tham số phải trả NEEDS_CLARIFICATION;
không tự mở rộng authorized scope.
end note
@enduml
